OL,3,GNEWSACity bar loses licence after
OL,4,Apolice concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city centre bar has had its licence
OL,7,Frevoked after police said it ignored
OL,8,Frepeated warnings.
OL,10,FA licensing committee was told the
OL,11,FAkedo bar, in Lincoln, had not
OL,12,Faddressed problems with drugs, CCTV and
OL,13,Fa lack of staff training despite
OL,14,Frepeated requests.
OL,16,FThe owner, Antonio Rovezzano, has
OL,17,Fappealed, claiming the decision was
OL,18,Funfair and the venue was being unfairly
OL,19,Ftargeted.
OL,21,FThe bar remains open while the appeal
OL,22,Fis considered.
